    "Scouting Notes": "Reliever?\n Spent all offseason hyping him up and he came out with far worse stuff and a complete loss of his command\n Velo is down, movement isn't as sharp and he can't locate at all\n Leaving my offseason grades for now, but know that the velocity is down into the upper 80's most of the time\n Weird fall off, honestly hoping he's dealing with an injury or something.",
    "Notes Updated 2": "12/15/2024",
    "Scouting Notes 2": "Reliever?\n Stuff is really intriguing sitting 91 93 on a legit cutter and up to 95\n Slider is sharp and has got some really bad swings against it\n Seems to have a bigger breaking ball too (CV?) which isn't bad\n Changeup definitely a WIP\n Overall super interesting profile that I would consider having start this year",
